  "_doc": "The CC0 texture sets the art pass draws with (Phase 10; render/DESIGN.md §2). tools/art/textures.mjs fetches each from its source at 1k, packs a colour map (sRGB), an OpenGL normal map and an ORM map (R ambient occlusion, G roughness, B metalness), resizes them to `resolution` square, and writes them with a manifest (each set's real size in metres, from the source) to game/client/public/art/textures/. Presentation only: the simulation never reads this file. Every source is CC0 (ASSET_SOURCES.md lists them).",
